WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:03.100
Came to YouTube for one SQL tutorial — lost 45 minutes to the feed and Shorts, until you flip Cairn ON.

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:07.300
Step 1, Intention Gate: Start with your goal, not the algorithm. Type what you came to learn.

00:00:07.380 --> 00:00:10.400
Step 2, Quiet Search: Shorts are hidden. Goal-matching tutorials lock on in green while clickbait dims out.

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.300
Calm Watch Page: Up Next recommendations stay blurred and unclickable, and comments stay collapsed.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 3, Commitment Lock: Lock Focus Mode for 1 to 8 hours right from the Cairn toolbar popup.

00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:18.700
Deliberate Friction: Impulse clicks hit a calm pause reminding you of the exact goal you came for.

00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:21.950
Cairn — Mark the path. Then walk it. 100% local viewing data, zero servers. Add Cairn to Chrome for free.
